/** @mainpage

This suite exercises tsf-gpio - driving the low-level buses of the Test
Agent it runs on, over libgpiod and the i2c/spi ioctls:

- @ref gpio-list - take a snapshot of the agent's GPIO chips (path,
  label, line count) and read one line back as an input.

It is read-only - it enumerates and reads, it never drives a line. What
is attached is the host's to decide, so the suite asserts no chip count:
an agent with no gpiochip passes cleanly. The point is that tsf-gpio
enumerates over the library (not by scraping a program) and parses the
chips into structured data.

*/
